From afb41dbbab717a8182b88351fdc717d6b8122e11 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Vicory <dvicory@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 02:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): route workers from durable lane specifications

Persist resolved worker specifications in task/run metadata, route dispatch and the model-facing API through registered catalogue lanes, and apply the frozen lane behavior to spawned workers.

This is one built-in Hermes routing feature rather than three correction layers over kanban_db.py and worker_lanes.py.
